# 默认由 Git 自动识别文本文件，并在仓库内与工作区统一为 LF
# （显式指定 eol 可不受各机器 core.autocrlf 设置影响，避免跨平台 diff 噪声）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# 语言统计 / diff 友好
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
